        {
          "no": 7,
          "code": "Antigua Tourism Levy - All Antigua hotels",
          "description": "Antigua Tourism Levy - All Antigua hotels",
          "note": "There is a new Tourism Guest Levy in Antigua, from the check ins 1st Oct 2021.\n\nThis is applicable to all guests 6 years and over for each night of the \nguest accommodation period in Antigua. The levy is US $5 per guest per night.\n\nThe levy will be collected locally at the resort upon check out and is requested to \nbe paid as a cash payment.",
