          "description": "Antigua - Tourism Guest Levy 2025",
          "note": "It is important we make you aware of the Tourism Guest Levy which applies to \nall hotels in Antigua. The fee applies to all guests aged 6 years and over, for \neach night of the accommodation period in Antigua.\n\nThe Levy is $5 USD per guest per night which will be collected in cash locally at \nthe resort upon check out.",
